  "foaf:name": "Regenerative Tides: Sailing for Solutions",
  "sdo:name": "Regenerative Tides: Sailing for Solutions",
  "sdo:description": "ReTISS is a grassroots citizen science project engaging coastal communities in mapping abandoned fiberglass boats, testing environmental samples, and co-creating advocacy tools. Blending science, art, and storytelling, it empowers citizen action to expose aquatic pollution, strengthen environmental stewardship, and influence regenerative policies across Brittany (France) and beyond.",
